<p><font size=&quot;2&quot;>Server was down 4 lyfe on Friday and for us lame EQ adicts boredom really set in.  Sure I had homework I could be doing, but I'd rather sit in EQ chat waiting for that server to come up, cause I don't wanna miss anything.  Sad and pathetic, yes, but then I think to myself "Hey self, at least you're not Zener." then I smile and everything is okay.  So anyways, we got bored and decided to invade the Nameless and become elite PK gnomez of death.  It turned out to be alot of fun, I think the Nameless locals were scared IRL of the Baar gnome invasion, fuck who wouldn't be scared of that? </font></p>
<p></p>
<p><font size=&quot;2&quot;>And now I present, two of the gayest things ever said in guild chat...ever.</p>
