  <p>&nbsp;</p>
  <p align="left"><font size="2">Well since we had so much fun killing Grieg the 
    other day we decided to go back and pay him another visit. Whats not to like 
    about getting blinded, snared, stunned, and knocked around. Enroute to Grieg 
    we made a quick detour, and killed Glen Thule. Glen Thule is a mob that is 
    the very definition of suck, but he does drop some sweet loots. I forgot to 
    take a picture of the dead Glen Thule, but just take my word.</font></p>
  <p align="left">&nbsp;</p>
