<p><font size="2"></font>Grudus sucks.  He high jacked my update yesterday.  That reminds me, Xammer sucks too.  I really hate Xammer.  If there is one mob I hate as much as Xammer in Everquest, it is that steaming pile of crap other people call Grieg Venewhatever.  Yeah, its almost a year after Luclin and PoP is out now but I think he is like our arch enemy, the Amy Fisher to our Buttafuco or whatever that guys name was.  Last night we FINALY evened the score, thanks mostly to Poneson and Ponejr the Dynamic Magician Duo.  Thanks again for the save guys!  Also special thanks to Zumtik for pointing out that the band Two Tone had a hit song called 'Jenny' in which they chant the stats on this curiass "867-5309", they must be fans of EQ! WOW!</p>
