<p><font size="2">Well Glen said he was going to do an update, but I think we 
  would have to wait at least a few more years for him to get anything out so 
  here is an update. Last Friday we went to NToV again and killed Aaryanor, Lord 
  Feshlak, Dagarn the Destroyer, Lord Kreizenn, Lord Koi'Doken, Lady Mirinella, 
  and almost killed Lord Vyemm. Well we couldn't have Lord Vyemm getting the better 
  of us so we head back on Monday and gave him a proper beat down. We also paid 
  a visit to Cekenar and Lady Nevederia.</font></p>
<p> </p>
